{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50878","headline":"赠王郎中棨（题拟，参阅前王棨小传） · 李颜","name":"赠王郎中棨（题拟，参阅前王棨小传）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬灜上客颜如玉，手探月窟如夜烛。\n笑顾姮娥玉兔言，谓折一枝情未足。\n（见黄璞撰《王郎中传》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}